-- Phase 7A seed: a small listening set built from existing content. Hindi (hi), A1.
-- Generated from frontend/content.js (PACKS.delhi) and the SOS_LIST in frontend/app.js. Every activity plays an EXISTING
-- vocabulary item; every option is another existing item. No audio files are shipped: playback uses the browser-TTS
-- fallback until audio_assets rows are added.
--   * per pack day: one choose_meaning (plays the day's 2nd phrase) and one choose_phrase (plays its 3rd phrase);
--     the two wrong options are the next two phrases of the same day, so they are plausible;
--   * Emergency: one choose_meaning on the SOS phrase "Where's the nearest hospital?".
-- Editorial, not from content.js: activity titles and prompts, difficulty (meaning 1, phrase 2, as recognising a meaning
-- is easier than picking the exact phrase), and the rotation of the correct option's position.

